@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Cover Letter";
    Layout = "_Layout";
}

<!-- Banner -->
<div class="hero-banner text-center text-white">
    <img src="~/img/bernd-dittrich-PSB6bGW-r7k-unsplash.jpg"
         alt="Monitor setup"
         class="hero-image" asp-append-version="true" />

    <div class="hero-text">
        <h1 class="display-3 fw-bold">Cover Letter</h1>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="container mt-5 pt-4" style="max-width: 800px;">
    <hr style="border-top: 4px solid #708090;" />
    <h2 class="text-center">Cover Letter</h2>
    <hr style="border-top: 4px solid #708090;" />

    <p class="mb-4">
        James Jones<br />
        Toronto, ON<br />
        james.c.jones.cs@gmail.com<br />
        https://www.linkedin.com/in/james-jones-64399a274/<br />
        March 18, 2026
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
        Dear Hiring Manager,
    </p>

    <p>
        I am a third-year Computer Programming and Analysis student at George Brown College, and I am excited to apply my
        skills in <strong>full-stack development, object-oriented programming, and modern software engineering practices</strong>
        to a dynamic development team. I have developed a strong technical foundation in technologies such as
        <strong>ASP.NET Core, Spring Boot, React, JavaScript/TypeScript, and Python</strong>, along with experience in
        <strong>mobile development across iOS (Swift) and Android (Java, Kotlin)</strong>.
    </p>

    <p>
        Through my academic projects, I have built and deployed scalable applications that reflect real-world development practices.
        In my <strong>CodeFolio portfolio application</strong>, I developed a full-stack web platform using ASP.NET Core, PostgreSQL,
        and Docker, implementing authentication, role-based access, and cloud deployment. I also designed and deployed a
        <strong>microservices-based learning management system</strong> using Spring Boot, REST APIs, and JWT authentication,
        gaining hands-on experience with distributed systems and cloud platforms such as Render and Vercel. Additionally,
        I developed a <strong>machine learning model for customer churn prediction</strong> using Python and Scikit-learn,
        strengthening my ability to work with data pipelines and analytical problem-solving.
    </p>

    <p>
        I am particularly interested in opportunities where I can contribute to building scalable, secure, and user-focused
        applications while continuing to grow as a developer. I am comfortable working in Agile environments, collaborating
        with teams, and leveraging modern tools—including AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor, and ChatGPT—
        to improve productivity and code quality.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
        Thank you for your time and consideration. I would welcome the opportunity to further discuss how my skills and
        experiences align with your team’s needs.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-5">
        Sincerely,
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
        James Jones
    </p>
</div>